---
const tags = [
  { label: 'Investigación', color: '#0A84FF', icon: 'search' },
  { label: 'Estrategia',    color: '#014D94', icon: 'target' },
  { label: 'Diseño',        color: '#0A84FF', icon: 'pen'    },
  { label: 'Validación',    color: '#FFC501', icon: 'check'  },
  { label: 'Evolución',     color: '#014D94', icon: 'trend'  },
];
---

<section class="relative py-32 bg-gradient-to-b from-am-dark to-am-blue/20">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">

      <!-- Text -->
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-8 reveal">
          Un proceso que <span class="text-am-accent">responde</span> a la realidad de cada proyecto
        </h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6 reveal" data-delay="0.1">
          No aplicamos recetas. Cada proyecto comienza con una comprensión profunda del contexto,
          los usuarios y los objetivos de negocio, y a partir de ahí construimos un camino que
          equilibre rigor metodológico con agilidad.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed reveal" data-delay="0.2">
          Nuestras etapas no son compartimientos estancos. Se retroalimentan constantemente para
          asegurar que las decisiones de diseño respondan a hallazgos reales y evolucionen con el proyecto.
        </p>

        <!-- Tags -->
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-10 reveal" data-delay="0.3">
          {tags.map((tag) => (
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full border"
              style={`background:${tag.color}15;border-color:${tag.color}40`}>
              {tag.icon === 'search' && (
                <svg class="w-4 h-4" style={`color:${tag.color}`} viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><path d="m21 21-4.35-4.35"/></svg>
              )}
              {tag.icon === 'target' && (
                <svg class="w-4 h-4" style={`color:${tag.color}`} viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/></svg>
              )}
              {tag.icon === 'pen' && (
                <svg class="w-4 h-4" style={`color:${tag.color}`} viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M17 3a2.828 2.828 0 1 1 4 4L7.5 20.5 2 22l1.5-5.5L17 3z"/></svg>
              )}
              {tag.icon === 'check' && (
                <svg class="w-4 h-4" style={`color:${tag.color}`} viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"/></svg>
              )}
              {tag.icon === 'trend' && (
                <svg class="w-4 h-4" style={`color:${tag.color}`} viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17"/><polyline points="16 7 22 7 22 13"/></svg>
              )}
              <span class="text-sm font-medium" style={`color:${tag.color}`}>{tag.label}</span>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Visual: bar chart decorative -->
      <div class="reveal-right" data-delay="0.3">
        <div class="relative bg-gradient-to-br from-am-blue/30 to-am-dark/30 backdrop-blur-sm border border-am-accent/20 rounded-2xl p-10">
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-6 font-medium uppercase tracking-widest">Distribución del proceso</p>
          <div class="space-y-5">
            {[
              { label: 'Investigación y descubrimiento', pct: 30, color: '#0A84FF' },
              { label: 'Definición y estrategia',        pct: 20, color: '#014D94' },
              { label: 'Diseño e ideación',              pct: 25, color: '#0A84FF' },
              { label: 'Validación y testing',           pct: 15, color: '#FFC501' },
              { label: 'Implementación y evolución',     pct: 10, color: '#014D94' },
            ].map((item) => (
              <div>
                <div class="flex justify-between mb-1.5">
                  <span class="text-gray-300 text-sm">{item.label}</span>
                  <span class="text-sm font-bold" style={`color:${item.color}`}>{item.pct}%</span>
                </div>
                <div class="h-2 bg-am-dark rounded-full overflow-hidden border border-am-accent/10">
                  <div class="h-full rounded-full progress-bar"
                    style={`width:${item.pct}%;background:${item.color};box-shadow:0 0 10px ${item.color}60;--bar-delay:0.4s`}></div>
                </div>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
